Orange: external participant. Navy: transformation. Green open-ended symbol: retained data. * repeats the same participant or record family; it is not a new system/store. Playable-media reads
use the chosen remote or local source. Network-dependent prefetch, sliding windows and cache eviction are sequence 34; no upload steps appear here. Mobile owns source selection and playback;
source data comes from R2/CDN or the mobile local cache.
